{"id":15370,"shortDescription":"Por primera vez, juega con la facción orca, recluta héroes, construye ejércitos y gestiona ciudades a medida que exploras y conquistas tierras legendarias. Emplea tácticas, habilidades y magia para aventajar a los fantásticos ejércitos al tiempo que desarrollas a tus héroes y desentrañas la siniestra conspiración que amenaza con destruir...","developers":["Nival"],"publishers":["Ubisoft"],"categories":["Un jugador","Préstamo familiar"],"releaseDateRaw":"10 OCT 2008","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/15370?t=1692823670","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/15370/0000004764.600x338.jpg?t=1692823670","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/15370/0000004764.1920x1080.jpg?t=1692823670"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/15370/0000004765.600x338.jpg?t=1692823670","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/15370/0000004765.1920x1080.jpg?t=1692823670"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/15370/0000004766.600x338.jpg?t=1692823670","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/15370/0000004766.1920x1080.jpg?t=1692823670"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/15370/0000004767.600x338.jpg?t=1692823670","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/15370/0000004767.1920x1080.jpg?t=1692823670"}],"movies":[],"hltbId":null,"hltbName":null}